4:T62c,These high-quality motorcycle gloves in a sporty black and red design combine safety, comfort, and a stylish look.
Made from genuine, abrasion-resistant cowhide leather, they offer reliable protection while maintaining excellent dexterity.
Integrated knuckle protectors and reinforced padding on the fingers and palms ensure maximum safety while riding.

Thanks to their soft inner surfaces and ergonomic design, the H07 gloves fit comfortably and allow for a relaxed riding experience, even on longer tours. The elastic accordion inserts on the back of the hand improve flexibility and ensure particularly comfortable handling of the throttle, brake, and clutch.

Details & Features:
Material: 100% genuine cowhide leather – robust, durable and abrasion-resistant
Ankle protection: Integrated hard-shell protector for optimal impact protection
Design: Sporty black and red look with elastic accordion zones
Palm: Reinforced grip zones for better hold and added safety
Finger protectors: Padded areas for increased protection
Closure: Adjustable Velcro closure for a perfect fit on the wrist.
Comfort: Ergonomic shape, soft inner material and flexible inserts
Fit: Pleasantly snug for precise driving feel
Ventilation: Partially perforated areas and breathable material structure
Area of ​​application:
Ideal for sport riders , touring riders , and city traffic .
Thanks to robust leather, protectors, and flexible areas, the glovesoffer a high level of safety combined with excellent comfort – perfect for anyone who values ​​a sporty, high-quality riding experience.8:["slug","men-s-motorcycle-gloves-with-knuckle-protection-black-red-pcp-lg-h07","d"]
